# Cloudflare Pages _headers — rules are MERGED when multiple match a URL.
# The trap (see CLAUDE.md): if two matching rules set the SAME header
# (notably Cache-Control), it gets duplicated and the conservative value
# wins, breaking immutable caching.
#
# Invariant that keeps this safe: the /* block sets ONLY security headers
# (never Cache-Control); the per-directory blocks set ONLY Cache-Control.
# So no single header is ever emitted by two matching rules. Keep it that
# way — do not add Cache-Control to /*, and do not add security headers to
# the asset blocks.
#
# Not set here (Cloudflare injects them automatically — adding would
# duplicate): X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, Referrer-Policy.
# HSTS is basic max-age only; includeSubDomains + preload is set via the
# Cloudflare dashboard at cutover, after the subdomain HTTPS audit (RFC 6797).

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=(), interest-cohort=()
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"; type="text/markdown"; title="Site index for LLMs"
  Link: </sitemap.xml>; rel="sitemap"; type="application/xml"
  Link: </.well-known/security.txt>; rel="security"; type="text/plain"
  Link: </.well-known/api-catalog>; rel="api-catalog"; type="application/linkset+json"

# RFC 9727 API catalog, served as an RFC 9264 Linkset. The file has no
# extension, so Cloudflare would otherwise serve it as application/octet-stream.
# Content-Type is set by no other matching rule, so the merge invariant holds
# (this block adds neither a security header nor Cache-Control).
/.well-known/api-catalog
  Content-Type: application/linkset+json; charset=utf-8

/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
